{"id":"P073-1","subject":"P","unit":"P073","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P073-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n한 변의 길이가 m인 정사각형 도체에 전류 A 가\n\n흐를 때, 정사각형 도체 중심에서의 자계는 몇ATm인가?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.4\n\n③ 4           ④ 50\n\n⑤ 200","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":567},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":779}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n10F의 공기 콘덴서가 있다. 이 콘덴서의 두 극판 사이\n\n에 절반두께의 유전체를 삽입할 때, 콘덴서의 정전용량은\n\n몇 F인가? (단, 유전체의 비유전율은 9이다.)\n\n\n① 18          ② 36\n\n③ 54          ④ 72\n\n⑤ 90","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":707},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":827}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n내압이 450V이고, 정전용량이 각각 20F,\n30F, 60F인 3개의 콘덴서를 직렬로\n\n연결했을 때, 전체 내압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 450         ② 675\n\n③ 900         ④ 1125\n\n⑤ 1350","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":530},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1057}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n비유전율이 인 유전체에 Vm의 전계가\n작용할 때, 분극의 세기Cm는?\n\n\n①           ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":545},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":694}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n그림과 같이 무한장 직선도체에 각각 A ,\nA의 전류가 흐를 때, 점의 자계가 0Am\n이었다. 이 경우, 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n           \n③           ④  \n\n    \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":846},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1188},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m05-e2.webp","width":696,"height":527}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n자기저항에 관한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 자기저항은 투자율에 반비례한다.\n\n② 자기저항은 단면적에 반비례한다.\n\n③ 자기저항은 자로의 길이에 비례한다.\n\n④ 자기저항은 비투자율에 반비례한다.\n\n⑤ 자기저항의 단위는 퍼미언스이다.","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":445},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":540}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n자속밀도가 10m인 평등자계 내에 10A의 전류가\n흐르고 있는 길이 mm의 직선도체를 자계방향에 대해\n\n30°의 각도로 놓았을 경우, 이 도체가 받는 힘은 약 몇N \n\n인가?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":614},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":818}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n단면적이 균일한 환상철심에 권수 400회인 A코일과 권수\n\n100회인 B코일이 있을 때, B코일의 자기 인덕턴스가 400\n\nmH라면, 두 코일의 상호 인덕턴스는 몇 mH 인가?\n\n\n① 800         ② 1000\n\n③ 1200         ④ 1600\n\n⑤ 3200","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":886}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\nΩ의