n":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n디지털 클럭이 0일 때는 낮은 주파수를, 1일 때는 높은\n\n주파수를 보내는 디지털 전송방식은?\n\n\n① ASK         ② FSK\n\n③ FDMA        ④ CDMA\n\n⑤ QPSK","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1063}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n4-PSK 변조방식에서 데이터의 전송속도가 19200bps\n\n일 때, 변조속도baud는?\n\n\n① 2400         ② 4800\n\n③ 9600         ④ 19200\n\n⑤ 35800","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":816}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n2200/200V 단상 변압기의 1차측 임피던스가 Ω,\n2차측 임피던스가 Ω일 때, 1차측 등가환산\n\n임던스는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n①       ② \n\n③       ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1066}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P073-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n동일한 정격의 3상 동기발전기 2대를 무부하로 병렬운전\n\n하고 있다. 두 발전기의 기전력 사이에 위상차가 30°인 경우,\n\n한 발전기에서 다른 발전기에 공급되는 유효전력은 몇\n\nkW인가? (단, 각 발전기의 1상의 기전력은 1000V,\n\n동기 리액턴스는 4Ω이고, 전기자 저항은 무시한다.)\n\n①          ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.08 한국철도공사(전기통신) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e06-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":652},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e06-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
